{"metadata":{"title":"Going further with more resources","role":"project","category":"Orange Unified Design System","categoryPathComponent":"Table-Of-Contents-(lime)"},"sections":[{"title":"Going further with more resources","chapter":"Go further with more ressources","estimatedTimeInMinutes":10,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Since you have learned how OUDS works with theme, themeable view, components, tuning and view modifiers, it is time now to discover some online resources.","type":"text"}]}],"backgroundImage":"ic_theme_intro.png","kind":"hero","image":"ic_theme_intro.png"},{"kind":"tasks","tasks":[{"anchor":"More-resources","contentSection":[{"kind":"contentAndMedia","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Xcode can use the Swift DocC documentation of OUDS, and this documentation is used to build a static web site.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"But there are also other resources which can be useful for you.","type":"text"}]}],"mediaPosition":"trailing"}],"title":"More resources","stepsSection":[{"runtimePreview":null,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The iOS technical documentation is available online. It has been generated from all the Swift DocC documentation written in the Swift Package.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You will find several catalogs (as many as libraries) with details about everything: components, tokens, themes, providers, etc.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can get it at ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],"media":"tutorial-lime-10-1.png","type":"step","code":null},{"runtimePreview":null,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The whole design system is documented and available online. You can find everything about components, tokens, guidelines and principles of OUDS.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"icon finder","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" is also available there to get icons for your projects.","type":"text"}]}],"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Go to the website and learn things at "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/unified-design-system.orange.com\/","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}]}],"media":"tutorial-lime-10-2.png","type":"step","code":null},{"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Have a look ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki"},{"text":" to discover how OUDS works.","type":"text"}]}],"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS iOS provides also a wiki attached to its GitHub repository. The wiki is a public base of knowledge with plenty of things: available API, technical architecture, tips about processes, tests, conventions and toolings."}]}],"code":null,"runtimePreview":null,"media":"tutorial-lime-10-3.png","type":"step"},{"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To get the source code of this showcase app, go to its dedicated GitHub repository at ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios-design-system-toolbox","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}],"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For technical reasons the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" GitHub repository does not embed the source code of the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"design system toolbox","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" app. In fact this app and all its snapshots for tests increases a lot the size of the repository."}]}],"code":null,"runtimePreview":null,"media":"tutorial-lime-10-4.png","type":"step"},{"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Do not hesitate to "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/issues"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/discussions"},{"type":"text","text":"!"}]}],"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS is open source, public and uses GitHub as forge. Thus, you will find common things inside the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios"},{"text":" GitHub repository.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"code":null,"runtimePreview":null,"media":"tutorial-lime-10-5.png","type":"step"}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-lime-10-going-further"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-lime-10-going-further"},"kind":"project","hierarchy":{"modules":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(lime)\/Import-of-the-Swift-Package-and-choose-its-libraries","projects":[{"sections":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-lime-1-package-and-libraries#Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries","kind":"task"},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-lime-1-package-and-libraries#Check-Your-Understanding","kind":"assessment"}],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-lime-1-package-and-libraries"}]},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(lime)\/Introduction","projects":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-lime-2-intro","sections":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesCont